# Every workspace copy, not just the live one. A rebuild left a backup beside
# it as `.logue-data.before-rebuild-<n>/`, which this pattern did not match —
# so 455 files of someone's recordings, and the API key sitting among them,
# went into a public repository and the key was revoked as leaked.
.logue-data*/
.logue-backups/
